	C73.6,17.8,74,18.3,74,18.8z M33.3,29.9V17.8h11.2v12.1L33.3,29.9z M44.6,32v46.7H33.3V32L44.6,32z M53.8,3.9c1.9-0.1,3.7,0.5,5,1.9
	c2.8,2.6,3.4,6.8,1.4,10H41c0.2-0.3,0.5-0.7,0.7-1C44.7,10.6,49.1,4.4,53.8,3.9z M19.1,5.8c1.3-1.4,3.2-2,5-1.9
	c4.7,0.5,9.1,6.7,12,10.9c0.3,0.4,0.5,0.7,0.7,1H17.7C15.7,12.5,16.3,8.3,19.1,5.8z M3.9,28.9V18.8c0-0.5,0.4-1,1-1h26.4v12.1H4.8
